[2026-11-16] OWNER DECISION - JWT_SECRET FALLBACK [DEC-2026-11-16-SECURITY-003]

Finding: auth.module.ts line ~8:
    const JWT_SECRET = process.env.JWT_SECRET ?? "netbill-dev-secret-change-in-prod"
    Fallback hardcoded ke string predictable bila env JWT_SECRET tidak di-set.
    Risk: production deployment tanpa JWT_SECRET env -> token signable dengan
    known secret -> auth bypass total.

Recommendation: fail-fast pada startup bila JWT_SECRET tidak di-set di
    non-development environment. Optional: Dev default hanya bila NODE_ENV
    explicit "development" atau "test".

Scope (future, belum dieksekusi):
    - auth.module.ts: validation + fail-fast
    - Deployment documentation: JWT_SECRET required
    - CI/CD: env check (bila ada pipeline)
    - Test: auth.module test untuk fail-fast behavior

Supersedes: none
Related: DEC-2026-11-16-SECURITY-001, commit c06c40e (F-9 observed saat
    Phase 1b assessment)

